<li>&lt;a href="Jalak%20suren"&gt;Jalak suren&lt;/a&gt; (Sturnus contra)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Jalak%20bodas"&gt;Jalak bodas&lt;/a&gt; (S. melanopterus)</li>
