MediaLine Entertainment nyaéta parusahaan rékaman ti &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Pausahaan ieu diadegkeun taun &lt;a href="1982"&gt;1982&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Jakarta%20Kulon"&gt;Jakarta Kulon&lt;/a&gt;. Hiburan ieu distributor Indonesian tina pilem Gambar Universal na DréamWorks. MediaLine narilep taun 2006 kana éta urang division sorangan MovieLine Hiburan, ninggalkeun Universal na DréamWorks ayeuna disebarkeun ku Visi Imah Hiburan. Relaunch ku sabab 2019, anu MediaLine Entertsinment resmi nahan pilem &lt;a href="Summit%20Entertainment"&gt;Summit&lt;/a&gt; urang, Dimension, &lt;a href="LionsGate"&gt;LionsGate&lt;/a&gt;, Trimark Pictures, Millenium Fims, &lt;a href="The%20Weinstein%20Company"&gt;The Weinstein Company&lt;/a&gt;, Moonstone Entertainment, &lt;a href="Filmnation%20Entertainment"&gt;Filmnation Entertainment&lt;/a&gt;, Alchemy, &lt;a href="Relativity%20Media"&gt;Relativity Media&lt;/a&gt; sarta Im-a-Gin-e.

