<doc id="73285" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=73285" title="Olimpiadeu Usum Panas 2016">
Olimpiadeu Usum Panas 2016

Olimpiade Usum Panas 2016 (&lt;a href="Basa%20Portugis"&gt;Basa Portugis&lt;/a&gt;:), sacara resmi nyaéta Games of the XXXI Olympiad (&lt;a href="Basa%20Portugis"&gt;Basa Portugis&lt;/a&gt;:) jeung ogé katelah Rio 2016, éta hiji internasional &lt;a href="acara%20multi-olahraga"&gt;acara multi-olahraga&lt;/a&gt; diayakeun ti 5&amp;nbsp;nepi ka 21&amp;nbsp;Agustus 2016 di &lt;a href="Rio%20de%20Janeiro"&gt;Rio de Janeiro&lt;/a&gt;, Brazil, jeung acara awal dina sababaraha olahraga dimimitian dina 3&amp;nbsp;Agustus. Rio diumumkeun salaku kota tuan rumah dina &lt;a href="Sesi%20IOC%20ka-121"&gt;Sesi IOC ka-121&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Kopenhagen"&gt;Kopenhagen, Dénmark&lt;/a&gt;, dina 2&amp;nbsp;Oktober 2009.
11.238 atlét ti 207 nagara milu dina Kaulinan 2016, kaasup nu mimiti asup &lt;a href="Kosovo%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Kosovo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sudan%20Kidul%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Sudan Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Tim%20Olimpiade%20Pengungsian%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Tim Olimpiade Pengungsi&lt;/a&gt;. Kalawan 306 sét medali, Kaulinan ieu nampilkeun 28 &lt;a href="Olahraga%20Olimpiade"&gt;Olahraga Olimpiade&lt;/a&gt;, i kaasup &lt;a href="rugbi%20tujuh"&gt;rugbi tujuh&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="golf"&gt;golf&lt;/a&gt;, nu ditambahkeun kana program Olimpiade di 2009. Ieu acara olahraga lumangsung di 33 tempat di kota tuan rumah jeung di lima tempat misah di kota Brasil &lt;a href="S%C3%A3o%20Paulo"&gt;São Paulo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Belo%20Horizonte"&gt;Belo Horizonte&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Salvador%2C%20Bahia"&gt;Salvador&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bras%C3%ADlia"&gt;Brasília&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Manaus"&gt;Manaus&lt;/a&gt;.
Ieu mangrupikeun &lt;a href="Olimpiade"&gt;Olimpiade&lt;/a&gt; munggaran anu diayakeun di &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Kidul"&gt;Amérika Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, ogé anu munggaran diayakeun di &lt;a href="Komunitas%20Nagara-nagara%20Basa%20Portugis"&gt;Nagara basa Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, édisi usum panas munggaran anu dilaksanakeun sapinuhna dina &lt;a href="Iklim%20Brazil"&gt;usum usum tiris nagara tuan rumah&lt;/a&gt;, anu munggaran ti saprak &lt;a href="Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%201968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt; dilaksanakeun di &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Latin%5D%20"&gt;Amérika Latin] &lt;/a&gt;, sarta kahiji saprak &lt;a href="2000%20Summer%20Olympics"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt; dilaksanakeun di &lt;a href="H%C3%A9misf%C3%A9r%20Kidul"&gt;Hémisfér Kidul&lt;/a&gt;. Ieu mangrupikeun ogé Olimpiade Usum Panas munggaran anu lumangsung di handapeun &lt;a href="Komite%20Olimpiade%20Internasional"&gt;Komite Olimpiade Internasional&lt;/a&gt; (IOC) kapersidenan &lt;a href="Thomas%20Bach"&gt;Thomas Bach&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Serikat%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Amérika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; ngaluhuran &lt;a href="m%C3%A9ja%20medali%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;méja medali&lt;/a&gt;, meunang medali emas panglobana (46) jeung jumlah medali pangluhurna sakabéhna (121); tim AS ogé meunang 1.000th Summer Olimpiade medali emas na sakabéh. &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Inggris Raya&lt;/a&gt; réngsé kadua sarta jadi nagara kahiji anu nambahan jumlah medali dina &lt;a href="Olimpiade"&gt;Olimpiade&lt;/a&gt; langsung sanggeus jadi &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202012"&gt;bangsa tuan rumah di 2012&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Cina%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; finish katilu dina tabel medali. Nagara tuan rumah &lt;a href="Brazil%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Brazil&lt;/a&gt; meunang tujuh medali emas jeung 19 medali, hasil pangalusna di Olimpiade mana waé, finish di tempat katilu belas. &lt;a href="Bahrain%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fiji%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Fiji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bayi%20Gading%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Basisir Gading&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yordania%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Yordania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kosovo%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Kosovo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pu%C3%A9rto%20Riko%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Puérto Riko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Singapura%20dina%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tajikistan%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Tajikistan&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Vietnam%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; kabéh meunang medali emas kahiji maranéhanana, kitu ogé grup &lt;a href="Atl%C3%A9t%20Olimpiade%20Independen%20di%20Olimpiade%20Usum%20Panas%202016"&gt;Atlét Olimpiade Mandiri&lt;/a&gt; (ti Kuwait).
